      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "738b1490b5af30e1",
      "translationZh": "复现 Nemotron 3 Nano 30B A3B 模型卡中的结果，只需遵循一个简单的循环流程：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
